The legal texts come from CyLaw, the Cyprus Bar Association's legal information service, run by the
Cyprus Institute of Legal Information (KINOP):

  CyLaw, https://www.cylaw.org, consolidated legislation and Official Gazette extracts, read from
  archived copies of its pages on the Internet Archive (https://web.archive.org), retrieved 2026-10-29.

Terms, as CyLaw states them (https://www.cylaw.org/terms.html): material published on the site, including
legislation, may be copied, printed and used free of charge and without further authorisation from KINOP,
provided the documents identify CyLaw as their source. Bulk or systematic downloading from the site, including
by automated processing, needs KINOP's prior written consent; no page was downloaded from cylaw.org for this
repository: every page was read from an Internet Archive copy. Material may also be subject to conditions set
by its original source.

Attribution:

  Πηγή: CyLaw (https://www.cylaw.org), Παγκύπριος Δικηγορικός Σύλλογος / ΚΙΝΟΠ.
  Source: CyLaw (https://www.cylaw.org), Cyprus Bar Association / KINOP.

This repository is private; whether and how it may be published is the owner's decision under these terms.

Changes made by Lexifina: each version was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph per
line; spacing, quotes, dashes and Latin look-alike letters inside Greek words were normalised; Part headings,
CyLaw's editorial notes and footnotes were left out; and the versions were arranged as git commits credited to
the laws CyLaw lists for each provision. The wording of the law was not changed. Neither CyLaw, KINOP nor the
Cyprus Bar Association endorses this repository.
